OL,3,GNEWSAWater resilience plans issued
OL,4,Aafter supply issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth East Water has announced a series
OL,7,Fof actions it is taking to make its
OL,8,Fsupply more resilient in an area on the
OL,9,FKent/East Sussex border where thousands
OL,10,Fof homes have been affected in the
OL,11,Fpast.
OL,13,FIn November 2025, 24,000 people lost
OL,14,Ftheir supply or pressure in the
OL,15,FTunbridge Wells area, and weeks later
OL,16,Fabout 30,000 households in Kent and
OL,17,FSussex faced days of supply issues,
OL,18,Fwhich were blamed on freezing
OL,19,Ftemperatures and Storm Goretti.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
