OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWater resilience plans issued
OL,4,Aafter supply issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company says it is installing new
OL,7,Ffiltration equipment and increasing the
OL,8,Famount of water available.
OL,10,FIt says it knows it "fell short" in the
OL,11,Fpast and is "determined to demonstrate
OL,12,Fthat lessons are being turned into real
OL,13,Faction".
